---
import LabelRow from "../ui/LabelRow.astro";
import "../../styles/about-descriptive.css";
---

<article class="about__block about__block--descriptive hover-group">
  <LabelRow
    text="DESCRIPTIVE"
    isAnimated={true}
    headingTag="h3"
    className="about__label-row"
  />
  <p class="about__body-text">
    <span class="about__intro-tag">[ ready's intro ]</span> He's Cristian Marcano
    <span class="about__intro-tag">[ 24 M ]</span>, Software Engineer by trade
    and professional problem-solver by nature. Based in Venezuela
    <span class="about__intro-tag">[ born there ]</span>. He cares a lot about
    things most people won't even notice. Sometimes a little too much. But
    that's also why the products he shapes feel effortless and make sense fast.
    <br /><br />
    With a background in computer science and software architecture, he works comfortably
    where technology meets creativity — logic on one side, intuition on the other.
    <br /><br />
    Right now, he's leading web development &amp; engineering strategy for a suite
    of digital applications, building things that are both intuitive for users and
    maintainable for developers.
  </p>
</article>
